# Deliberately NOT ignored -------------------------------------------------
# backend/.env holds no secrets — every model runs locally — and it records the
# exact model configuration behind the results, which the write-up needs.
#
# "vision/cattle_lsd_detector.keras" (11 MB) and visual_index.npz
# (4.6 MB) are committed on purpose: without them the application cannot run,
# and neither can be regenerated here because the training dataset is not part
# of this repository.
